 based on these data were adjusted for nonresponse using the inverse of the response rate, stratified by school type\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Weights were calculated to account for sample design and adjusted for nonresponse.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"medians indicate the midpoint of state-level coverage, irrespective of population size.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}